{"id":"LEARNING-PRACTICE-company-graphics-roblox-action-motion-g1","gameId":null,"target":"web","robloxPracticeDrill":null,"codingPracticeDrill":null,"department":"learning","type":"research","goal":"[VIBE_LEARNING_PRACTICE]\nkind=ACTION_MOTION_LIBRARY_DRILL\ndomains=LIVING_MOTION,ANIMATION_FEEL\npracticeGeneration=1\npracticeMode=WEB_ARTIFACT\ncompanyGraphicsLibrary=YES\nplatformProfile=ROBLOX\n소스 파일을 수정하지 않는다. 액션 게임에 바로 쓸 수준의 공용 모션팩을 설계·검증한다. idle 4종 이상, 8방향 이동, 시작/정지/회전, 점프/착지, 회피, 가드/패링, 경직/넉백/다운/기상, 방향별 피격, 사망 3종 이상과 anticipation→acceleration→impact→hit-stop→recoil→recovery를 포함한다.\n이 결과는 연습 전용이며 production PASS, QA PASS, release evidence로 사용할 수 없다.","responsibleFiles":[],"dependencies":[],"priority":"low","releaseState":"other","status":"queued","retries":0,"maxRetries":1,"ownerDirective":false,"requiresOwnerDecision":false,"protectedChange":false,"paidResourceRequired":false,"sourceRoot":"learning-practice:company-graphics-roblox-action-motion","speculativeEligible":false,"estimatedRisk":"low","evidence":["learning-practice-only","production-pass:NO","practice-kind:ACTION_MOTION_LIBRARY_DRILL","practice-generation:1","learning-web-artifact-practice","company-graphics-library-24h","company-graphics-library-prepared-not-promoted","company-graphics-platform:ROBLOX","practice-domain:LIVING_MOTION","practice-domain:ANIMATION_FEEL"],"completionCriteria":["PRACTICE_WEB_ARTIFACT_VERIFIED","REPOSITORY_SOURCE_WRITE_ZERO","PRODUCTION_PASS_NO"]}